### 15. Express Keep-Alive & Asynchronous Non-Blocking Disk Persistence ✅ RESOLVED
- **Root Cause**: Node.js default 5s HTTP Keep-Alive timeout caused socket race conditions with Next.js proxy client pooled connections, while synchronous `fs.writeFileSync` on ~330MB JSON blocked the Node main event-loop thread for 1.5–2 seconds.
